    572  f41f							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    573  f41f							; M1StripBlast — Phase 4 M1 strip blast (moved from bank2 2026-10-20, repack
    574  f41f							; chunk 2). Reads ZP ONLY (RectCount / RoomMetaA-B / EnemyDeadMask /
    575  f41f							; BMWScratch), so it runs here and the old two-hop pad chain
    576  f41f							; (.BMWDone -> pad $F9AC -> bank2 -> pad $F9B2) collapses to a same-bank
    577  f41f							; jal: BombMarkWalls .BMWDone -> M1StripBlast -> StripBlastCheck, 0 switches.
    578  f41f							; Staging contract (both scratch bytes free in this flow):
    579  f41f							;   RectCount := 2ℓ left-strip dcol, or $FF = none/door/right-bomb;
    580  f41f							;   BMWScratch ($88 = kernel Temp, NOT bank1's Temp $AD) := $FF when MetaB
    581  f41f							;   b7 (right door) so the ball-strip take can never fire. Key pickup (P5)
    582  f41f							;   sets b3/b4 for doors instead (comment hook at the takes).
    583  f41f							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    584  f41f				   M1StripBlast
    585  f41f		       a5 92		      lda	RectCount	; original screen col (BMW prologue stash)
    586  f421		       c9 14		      cmp	#20
